        `$\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{n} \\cdot \\frac{1}{1 + ${a === 1 ? '' : a * a}\\left(\\frac{k}{n}\\right)^2} \\to \\int_0^1 \\frac{dx}{1 + ${a === 1 ? '' : a * a}x^2} = ${ans}$.`
